    "short_description": "A frenetic hand-drawn bullet hell shooter, blending run-and-gun mechanics with classic shmup action in looping arenas. Inspired by drawn-on-film animation of the 1930's - shoot, dash and pound your way through the Animator's creations.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cWow, would you look at it: this arcade-style shoot-'em-up that looks and feels and even sounds the part, thanks to the jazzy, old-timey soundtrack accompanying the action\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cEven in these early stages of development it\u2019s a great little shooter with a fantastic filmic visual style and a nice amount of depth to its fast paced arcade action\u201d<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br><br>\u201cIn ZOE Begone!, you dodge and unleash attacks at blistering speed before the game erupts into a euphoric shower of pointillist colour, dazzling the eyes and punishing the thumbs.\u201d<br>The Guardian<br>",
